    "public_api_change": "ADDITIVE",
    "schema_diff_summary": "movement.rs has one test module named tests. Add the new test function at the end of that module, before its closing brace. Do not write a second mod tests. Change only is_in_word. The body is !is_default_delimiter(ch) && !ch.is_whitespace() && !matches!(ch, '\"' | '`'). An apostrophe is not in that exclusion. Do not nest an if inside an if. Do not touch is_word_char, is_default_delimiter, kind_of, word_next, word_prev, cursor_forward, cursor_back, or move_selection. The existing test an_apostrophe_stays_inside_the_word stays green. The test word_right_from_an_apostrophe_stays_in_the_word uses TextBuffer::from_str of don't. move_selection of WordRight from Selection::caret of Offset(3) with Extend::No and ctx() has head Offset(5). The same move from Offset(0) stays at Offset(5). Branch from the current tip of main. base_sha records that tip at planning time. If main has moved, use the new tip. Keep the change under about 60 lines."
  },
